[gd_scene format=3]

; The GameCube Microphone's 2 m cord and its plug. Rope as nunchuk_cable.tscn,
; 56 x 36 mm, black. The plug is 35.6 x 13.7 x 63 mm: a card-thick tongue that
; enters the slot and a housing that stays out of it. Long axis Z, connector end
; at -Z where a memory card's is, so a seated plug sits as deep as a card.

